〗。数月，典军吏刘助觉〖10〗，言王遂所取。权大感悟，曰：“朱据见枉，况吏民乎？”乃穷治壹罪，赏助百万。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-83f1f7038987a7ade35c","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"数月，典军吏刘助觉〖10〗，言王遂所取","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":110,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ec26171254eb0e4bff28","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"权大感悟，曰：“朱据见枉，况吏民乎？”乃穷治壹罪，赏助百万","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":130,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
